---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="关于我">
  <article class="about-page">
    <h1 class="page-title">关于我</h1>

    <section class="about-intro">
      <p>你好，我是一名刚毕业的游戏美术师，专注于 3D 建模、游戏场景制作和 3D 扫描。</p>
      <p>我热爱用数字工具创造沉浸式的视觉体验，擅长将概念设计转化为高质量的游戏资产。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-contact">
      <h2>联系方式</h2>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li>邮箱：<a href="mailto:your@email.com">your@email.com</a></li>
        <li>ArtStation：<a href="#">artstation.com/yourname</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-intro {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-intro p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-contact h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .contact-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .contact-list li {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .contact-list a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
</style>
